# Streamlit application rules

This directory is the user-owned application area.

- Keep `app.py` as the main entry point. The Dockerfile copies it directly into `WORKDIR`, matching the current Serve guide pattern.
- Keep port 8501 and `--server.address=0.0.0.0`.
- Keep Streamlit usage-statistics gathering disabled in the container command.
- Do not add application user registration, a user database, sensitive data, or persistent per-user state.
- Use approved Serve storage mount paths only for non-sensitive files required by the app.
- Keep runtime dependencies in `requirements.txt`; starter policy uses exact `==` pins.

Reference: https://serve.scilifelab.se/docs/application-hosting/streamlit/
